","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-13T16:52:03Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T16:52:03Z","body":"Discussed on 2023-07-13 legal team call. For item 3 from @jlovejoy's list above, presence of \"_source code_ copies\" is arguably substantively different from HP-1986 so it warrants a separate identifier.\r\n\r\nAgreed to add using the identifier `HP-1989` and name  \"Hewlett-Packard 1989 License\", subject to @Pizza-Ria reaching out to HP and seeing if they have a different position here. Would include notes indicating the difference from HP-1986 to this one.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634575019/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634602805","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2019#issuecomment-1634602805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2019","id":1634602805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85hbg81","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-13T17:06:25Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T17:06:25Z","body":"Will copy you and Jilayne on the email to Guarav at HP.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634602805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634809827","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2019#issuecomment-1634809827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2019","id":1634809827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85hcTfj","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-13T19:42:36Z","updated_at":"2023-07-13T19:42:36Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [X] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\n\r\nHewlett-Packard 1989 License\r\n\r\n## License ID\r\n\r\nHP-1989\r\n\r\n## XML markup\r\n\r\nnone at this point\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\nThis license is the same as HP-1986, but adds a specific provision that the \"the above copyright notices and this notice appears in all source code copies\" whereas HP-1986 omits \"source code\". \r\n\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nFiles to be made once HP representative has had a chance to view and weigh in\r\n\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1634809827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1640905903","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2019#issuecomment-164090590